The petitioners are directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No.37/2024 registered by Babaleshwar Police Station, Vijayapura District for the offences punishable under Sections 498A, 304B R/w 34 of IPC and Section 4 of Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961,
subject to the following conditions:
Mahadevi And Anr vs The State Of Karnataka And Anr on 30 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/93137340/
3 a) Petitioners shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- each with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioners shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts their appearance for valid reasons;
NC: 2024:KHC-K:3455 c) The petitioners shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioners shall not involve in similar offences in future;
e) The petitioners shall cooperate with the police for investigation.
